# GLOBAL RULES

## 1. INTERVAL (STRICT)

Format: DD:HH:MM
Zero padded
NEVER use Yes/No
If no interval → ""

Examples:

every 2 hours → "00:02:00"
every 30 minutes → "00:00:30"
every 2 days 4 hours 30 minutes → "02:04:30"

---

## 2. TIME FORMAT

Always 24-hour HH:MM
6 PM → 18:00
U
se en-dash (–) for ranges

---

## 3. DATE EXTRACTION (MANDATORY)

If TWO dates → first = start, second = end
If ONE date → start only
If NONE → both null

Convert to YYYY-MM-DD.

